s to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllCheckboxComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide all tokens to the users."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CheckboxComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"checkboxes"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Checkboxes"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SizeSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":") and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"borders ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BorderRadiusSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BorderWidthSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These components share the same type of tokens which are all gathered here."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BlueCoatThemeCheckboxComponentTokensProvider"}]},"doc://MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat/documentation/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This BlueCoat theme